<div>

    <h5>Photo Upload</h5>


    <div class="form-group">
        <label class="col-sm-2 control-label"><label class="required">Photo:</label></label>
        <div class="col-sm-10">

            <img id="uploadphotoImage" width="200" height="200" src="" />
            <input name="uploadphoto" id="uploadphoto" type="file" />
        </div>
    </div>

    <h5>General Photo Guidelines</h5>
    <ul style="margin-bottom:20px; padding-left:20px; list-style-type:disc;">
        <li>Digitize the Photo: Capture a digital image of the photo using a high-quality camera or scanner.</li>
        <li>Format and Save: Save the digital photo in a format specified by the portal, such as JPEG, and ensure it meets file size and pixel dimensions, like a square aspect ratio of at least 600x600 pixels and under 240KB.</li>
        <li>Background: Use a plain white or off-white background with no shadows, lines, or textures.</li>
        <li>Lighting: The photo should be well-lit with indirect light to avoid glare or shadows on your face.</li>
        <li>Position: Face the camera directly with your full face visible. No profile shots or selfies are allowed.</li>
        <li>Expression: Maintain a neutral facial expression with both eyes open.</li>
        <li>Head Size: The size and position of your head must be correct.</li>
        <li>Clothing: Wear normal daily clothing. Do not wear uniforms, hats, or head coverings.</li>
    </ul>

    <footer class="col-xs-12 form-group text-center">
        <button id="Previous3" type="submit" style="width:100px;height:50px;" data-bind="click: Previous" class="btn btn-info btn-lg"><strong>Previous</strong></button>
        <button id="Step3" type="submit" style="width:100px;height:50px;" data-bind="click: Step3" class="btn btn-info btn-lg"><strong>Next</strong></button>

    </footer>
</div>









